# Example .envrc file for using dev shells with nix-direnv
#
# Usage:
# 1. Copy this file to your project directory as `.envrc`
# 2. Uncomment the shell you want to use
# 3. Run `direnv allow` in your project directory

# For PHP 8.4 + Node.js projects
# use flake system#php84

# For legacy PHP 7.4 projects
# use flake system#php74

# Or using full path:
# use flake /Users/bear/src/p/nix-config#php84
